    "text": "Sometimes beginning again doesn’t look brave.⁠\n⁠\nSometimes it looks like resting.⁠\nLike changing your mind.⁠\nLike walking away from what no longer fits.⁠\nLike trying once more after thinking you couldn’t.⁠\n⁠\nThere is no limit to how many times you’re allowed to return to yourself.⁠\n⁠\nStart where you are.⁠\nThat is enough.",
